    LLM: "Draw OR meld (not both). Sets (3-4 same rank, different suits) and Runs (3+ sequential same suit). First meld = sequence from hand. REARRANGE existing table melds to add cards. Jokers wild but can't move directly between melds. Replace joker with actual card to free it.",
    Player: "Draw OR meld (not both). Sets (3-4 same rank, different suits) and Runs (3+ sequential same suit). First meld = sequence from hand. REARRANGE existing table melds to add cards. Jokers wild but can't move directly between melds. Replace joker with actual card to free it.",
